{"id":"55266516c016ab89","group":"88","path":"88/88-cor-universal-halts.md","title":"Universal Machine Halts","display":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-cor-universal-halts","aliases":["88-cor-universal-halts"],"display":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts","depends_on":["[[88-df-universal-tm]]","[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","[[88-df-decidable-set]]","[[88-df-tm-halts]]","[[88-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-cor-universal-halts"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-cor-universal-halts</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-universal-halts — Universal Machine Halts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5ec4a3797008b26\" href=\"?note=c5ec4a3797008b26\" title=\"88-thm-halting-problem\">88-thm-halting-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\\)</span> (universal machine, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\">\\(\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\)</span> (halting predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a93cc0702f1280f5\" href=\"?note=a93cc0702f1280f5\" title=\"88-df-tm-halts\">88-df-tm-halts</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(\\mathrm{enc}:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span> (pairing/tuple code, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x)\\)</span> (binary input word, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3b05ff7db230d81f\" href=\"?note=3b05ff7db230d81f\" title=\"88-df-encoding\">88-df-encoding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> (decidable-set predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}universal\\text{-}halts} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\}\n\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}universal\\text{-}halts} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{UniversalTM}(U,(M_e)_{e\\in\\mathbb N})\n\\to\n\\neg\\mathrm{Decidable}\n\\bigl(\n\\{\\mathrm{enc}(e,x):\ne,x\\in\\mathbb N\\land\\mathrm{Halts}_U(\\mathrm{wordenc}(e,x))\\}\n\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> : 通用图灵机 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"74864270657b435d\" href=\"?note=74864270657b435d\" title=\"88-df-universal-tm\">88-df-universal-tm</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}\\)</span> : 可判定谓词 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a6c52aed1a56207b\" href=\"?note=a6c52aed1a56207b\" title=\"88-df-decidable-set\">88-df-decidable-set</a>)</li>\n<li>通用机的停机问题不可判定 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c5ec4a3797008b26\" href=\"?note=c5ec4a3797008b26\" title=\"88-thm-halting-problem\">88-thm-halting-problem</a>)</li>\n<li>Turing原证明的核心</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-universal-tm","status":"resolved","id":"74864270657b435d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-universal-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-thm-halting-problem","status":"resolved","id":"c5ec4a3797008b26","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-thm-halting-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-decidable-set","status":"resolved","id":"a6c52aed1a56207b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-decidable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-tm-halts","status":"resolved","id":"a93cc0702f1280f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-tm-halts]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-encoding","statu